ll="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.04 L 0 122.5 C 0 125.29 2.26 127.55 5.04 127.55 L 472.33 127.55 C 475.12 127.55 477.38 125.29 477.38 122.5 L 477.38 5.04 C 477.38 2.26 475.12 0 472.33 0 L 5.04 0 C 2.26 0 0 2.26 0 5.04 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 5.04 L 1.11 122.5 C 1.11 124.68 2.87 126.44 5.04 126.44 L 472.33 126.44 C 474.51 126.44 476.27 124.68 476.27 122.5 L 476.27 5.04 C 476.27 2.87 474.51 1.11 472.33 1.11 L 5.04 1.11 C 2.87 1.11 1.11 2.87 1.11 5.04 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 7.81 10.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.37em;--ltx-fo-height:7.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="111.93" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 109.24)" width="461.75"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S5.SS2.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.37em;">
<span id="S5.SS2.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS2.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Finding 4:<span id="S5.SS2.p4.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
Human evaluation confirms the superiority of our agent-based approach. Experts rated <span id="S5.SS2.p4.pic1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SWE-QA-Agent</span>’s answers significantly higher across all dimensions, especially in Completeness and Reasoning, corroborating the findings from our automated LLM-as-Judge evaluation.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">5.3. </span>RQ3: Taxonomy-Aware Analysis</h3>

