ll="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.04 L 0 105.9 C 0 108.69 2.26 110.94 5.04 110.94 L 472.33 110.94 C 475.12 110.94 477.38 108.69 477.38 105.9 L 477.38 5.04 C 477.38 2.26 475.12 0 472.33 0 L 5.04 0 C 2.26 0 0 2.26 0 5.04 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 5.04 L 1.11 105.9 C 1.11 108.07 2.87 109.84 5.04 109.84 L 472.33 109.84 C 474.51 109.84 476.27 108.07 476.27 105.9 L 476.27 5.04 C 476.27 2.87 474.51 1.11 472.33 1.11 L 5.04 1.11 C 2.87 1.11 1.11 2.87 1.11 5.04 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 7.81 10.5)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:33.37em;--ltx-fo-height:6.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="95.32" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 92.63)" width="461.75"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S5.SS3.p4.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.37em;">
<span id="S5.SS3.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS3.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Finding 5:<span id="S5.SS3.p4.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
Models’ performance varies significantly across question types. They excel at high-level conceptual questions (e.g., “Why” and “What”) that can often be answered from documentation, but struggle with low-level procedural and locational questions (e.g., “How” and “Where”) that require deep code comprehension and dependency tracing.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
